WEBVTT

00:20:28.876 --> 00:20:30.636
So no, at any age, you’re capable --

00:20:30.636 --> 00:20:32.996
So as you grow older,

00:20:33.036 --> 00:20:37.276
you don't lose the information
of stuff you've learned.

00:20:37.316 --> 00:20:39.836
So the stuff, your semantic memory.

00:20:39.876 --> 00:20:42.716
So this is why you've accumulated
a body of knowledge

00:20:42.756 --> 00:20:44.956
and you've got wisdom now, right?

00:20:44.996 --> 00:20:46.756
Because now you know how it all fits

00:20:46.756 --> 00:20:48.916
and you can use that wisdom
you've collected.

00:20:48.916 --> 00:20:50.116
You've got that.

00:20:50.556 --> 00:20:52.676
It's not that that starts to go away.

00:20:52.676 --> 00:20:54.996
You accumulate that.

00:20:55.036 --> 00:20:56.916
And you might think like,

00:20:56.956 --> 00:20:59.396
"Oh, I don't remember much from childhood.

00:20:59.436 --> 00:21:00.796
I can't really think about,"